#
# PURPOSE (#9927 step D2-2 / #12158, design arm-token-replacement-design-12158.md,
# CTO ruling D1c): the Terraform GitHub App cannot write GitHub ENVIRONMENT secrets
# (the 403 recorded in apps/web-platform/infra/inngest-arm-write-token.tf), so the
# new read/write Doppler token doppler_service_token.inngest_cutover_write reaches
# the `inngest-cutover` environment only through this relay: read the sensitive
